// (shaders/include/rtxcr/geometry.hlsli). Provides the analytic rounded-cone
// intersector used to reconstruct smooth shading normals for Linear Swept
// Sphere (LSS) hair segments, and for the Disjoint Orthogonal Triangle Strip
// (DOTS) fallback representation of the same curves.

